msgid "Popular and well-supported"
msgstr "Gewild en goed ondersteun"

msgid "A polished desktop with excellent hardware support and a large software library. A safe default for most laptops."
msgstr "’n Afgewerkte werkskerm met uitstekende hardeware-ondersteuning en ’n groot sagtewarebiblioteek. ’n Veilige keuse vir die meeste skootrekenaars."

msgid "Familiar and easy"
msgstr "Bekend en maklik"

msgid "A stable desktop that feels at home for people coming from Windows. Multimedia and drivers work out of the box."
msgstr "’n Stabiele werkskerm wat tuis voel vir mense wat van Windows af kom. Multimedia en drywers werk dadelik."

msgid "Modern Plasma desktop"
msgstr "Moderne Plasma-werkskerm"

msgid "Current free software with a polished KDE Plasma experience. Good choice if you want recent packages and solid defaults."
msgstr "Hedendaagse vrye sagteware met ’n afgewerkte KDE Plasma-ervaring. ’n Goeie keuse as jy onlangse pakkette en stewige standaardinstellings wil hê."

msgid "Ubuntu with KDE Plasma"
msgstr "Ubuntu met KDE Plasma"

msgid "The power of Ubuntu with the highly customizable KDE Plasma desktop."
msgstr "Die krag van Ubuntu met die hoogs aanpasbare KDE Plasma-werkskerm."

msgid "Very lightweight"
msgstr "Baie liggewig"

msgid "Ubuntu with LXQt. Ideal for older machines or when you want maximum free memory."
msgstr "Ubuntu met LXQt. Ideaal vir ouer masjiene of as jy soveel moontlik vrye geheue wil hê."

msgid "Elegant and efficient"
msgstr "Elegant en doeltreffend"

msgid "The Budgie desktop on Ubuntu — modern, clean, and approachable."
msgstr "Die Budgie-werkskerm op Ubuntu — modern, netjies en toeganklik."

msgid "Classic desktop layout"
msgstr "Klassieke werkskermuitleg"

msgid "Traditional menus and panels with the stability of Ubuntu LTS."
msgstr "Tradisionele spyskaarte en panele met die stabiliteit van Ubuntu LTS."

msgid "Lightweight and fast"
msgstr "Liggewig en vinnig"

msgid "Ubuntu with the Xfce desktop — lower resource use, still fully featured."
msgstr "Ubuntu met die Xfce-werkskerm — minder hulpbronne, steeds volledig."

msgid "This will erase the internal disk and copy First Boot Linux onto it."
msgstr "Dit sal die interne skyf uitvee en First Boot Linux daarop kopieer."

msgid "Install {name}?"
msgstr "Installeer {name}?"

msgid "This will erase this computer and install {name}. Create the account you will use after restart."
msgstr "Dit sal hierdie rekenaar uitvee en {name} installeer. Skep die rekening wat jy ná herbegin sal gebruik."

