msgstr "Bou skyfbeeld"

msgid "Writing to disk"
msgstr "Skryf na skyf"

msgid "Downloading image"
msgstr "Laai beeld af"

msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "Begin…"

msgid "Waiting for permission…"
msgstr "Wag vir toestemming…"

msgid "Stopped."
msgstr "Gestop."

msgid "Cancelled."
msgstr "Gekanselleer."

msgid "Done."
msgstr "Klaar."

msgid "Done. You can boot PCs from that stick."
msgstr "Klaar. Jy kan rekenaars van daardie stokkie af laai."

